#HELPS
1 ERABENIMSUN CAMP~
Erabenimsun Camp is a hostile Ashlander settlement in the center of Molag Amur
where hide yurts stand amid ashen hills claimed by a fierce and warlike tribe.
A trader, healer and wise woman serve the camp under the gaze of armed hunters
as divisions between peace and violence trouble tribal life.~
